flowchart TD
 Submit[Browser form submission] --> Validate[Server Form Request]
 Validate --> Valid{Validation passes?}
 Valid -->|No| FieldErrors[Redirect with validation errors]
 Valid -->|Yes| Controller[Controller persistence]
 Controller --> Success{Store operation succeeds?}
 Success -->|No| Log[Write server-side operational log]
 Log --> SafeError[Return generic failure message]
 Success -->|Yes| Flash[Redirect with success message]
